<title>USA: American Stores Co sets two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>American Stores Co sets two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Stores Co said its board has declared a two-for-one stock split, payable July 16, record July 1.</p>
<p>The company currently has about 136.1 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>The board also increased its dividend rate on the company's common stock to $0.18 per share ($0.09 post-split) from $0.16 a share (8 cents post-split).</p>
<p>The dividend is payable July 10, record June 27.</p>
</text>
